Z||000000||FieroJoe||04-23-2001||10:24 PM||||Well, I finally finished up with my resto, for the most part!  When I got home this afternoon, I messed around with my seats and got them in, and took it out on the road!  It was so fun.  I've missed it so very much!<P>Today was the first time that I have driven my Fiero since october.  I have been on this forum since november and havent even driven a Fiero until now!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Today we had thunderstorms and pouring rain, but I'll post some pics as soon as I get it all cleaned up right and get it shiney again.<P>I've got a box o engine mods that I hope I can get to put on, it defiantly needs some more power.  I'll get to those when I fix my backup lights, and find the causes for code 44 and 15  (both of those were set today :rolleyes <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Anyways, Im very happy that she's back!<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Fiero87311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto near completion!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||10
